  "question": {
    "text": "All words, with or without meaning, are made using all the letters of the word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>Y</mi></math>. These words are written as in a dictionary with serial numbers. The serial number of the word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>Y</mi></math> is",
